    "details": "<p><strong>KILN &rsquo;26</strong> is a national‑level hybrid hackathon organized by <a href=\"https://coherelive.tech\">Coherelive</a>, designed to test real builders through a four‑stage crucible of ideation, screening, prototyping, and live pitching. With a prize pool of <strong>₹35,000+</strong>, trophies, and verified certificates, it offers a unique mix of online and offline challenges for students and developers across India.</p>\n<ul role=\"list\">\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Hybrid (Online + Offline)</li>\n<li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> College students, fresh graduates, and self‑taught developers</li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Free</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Four Rounds</p>\n<ul role=\"list\">\n<li><strong>Blueprint Submission (till 26 Sep)</strong> &mdash; Pitch your idea deck online.</li>\n<li><strong>Screening Quiz (28 Sep)</strong> &mdash; Test fundamentals on Unstop.</li>\n<li><strong>Virtual Hackathon (1 Oct)</strong> &mdash; A full‑day online sprint to build a working prototype.</li>\n<li><strong>Grand Finale (15 Oct)</strong> &mdash; In‑person Demo Day with live pitches, networking, and awards.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Problem Tracks</p>\n<ul role=\"list\">\n<li>AI Agents &amp; Workflow Automation</li>\n<li>Civic &amp; Public Utilities</li>\n<li>Climate &amp; Urban Resilience</li>\n<li>Low‑Bandwidth Healthcare</li>\n<li>Open Innovation &amp; DevTools</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Rewards</p>\n<ul role=\"list\">\n<li><strong>₹20,000 Grand Champion Prize</strong> + Trophy</li>\n<li><strong>₹10,000 Runner‑Up Prize</strong> + Trophy</li>\n<li><strong>₹5,000 Best Track Innovation Award</strong></li>\n<li>Certificates for all verified participants</li>\n</ul>",
